  "descripcion": "Experience legendary American trucks and deliver various cargoes across sunny California, sandy Nevada, and the Grand Canyon State of Arizona. American Truck Simulator takes you on a journey through the breathtaking landscapes and widely recognized landmarks around the States.",
  "generos": [
    "Indie",
    "Simuladores"
  ],
  "lanzamientoTexto": "2 FEB 2016",
